  "title": "The Strong Nazirite",
  "era": "judges",
  "lifespan": "c. 1100–1050 BC",
  "summary": "Samson was a Nazirite from birth, endowed with supernatural strength given by God. He judged Israel for 20 years and fought against the Philistines. His weakness for women led to his downfall when Delilah tricked him into revealing the secret of his hair, but in death he killed more Philistines than during his life.",
